- * lineage), which in turn followed the Adreno 642L staged bring-up of
- * hackios-xnu-kernel (bsd/dev/redwood_adreno.c, APSL 2.0). The lesson from
- * both: touching GPU registers while the GPU config-bus clock is off freezes
- * the phone, so every step reads first and says what it is about to do.
- *
- * Nothing runs unless boot-arg sweetgpu=N asks for steps 1..N:
- *
- *   1  read   main clock controller (GCC 0x100000): the GPU config-bus clock
- *             (the gate in front of the GPU clock controller), memnoc/snoc
