- *   6  read   the GMU (0x3d6a000, same layout as SM7325): reset, boot and HFI
- *             state, plus its always-on counter, which counts the 19.2 MHz
- *             crystal once the block is alive
+ *             it: PLL1, the GMU clock source and branches, the CX power
